<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Caccept</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>caccept &lt;player&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>caccept fizban
</pre>
<p>Takes a player into your clan. They get the clan's tattoo, start at clan 
rank 1, and the clan house becomes their hometown, where word of recall 
takes them.
</p><p>You must be the clan Master or Lord, or have clan rank 10 or higher, to use 
caccept. The player must be in the game, and not already in a clan. They 
are not asked first, so make sure they want to join. Gods can't be in 
clans.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cremove</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cdefect</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cinfo</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>